# Line endings are declared, not inferred.
#
# This repository commits a generated artifact (index/gallery.html) that a
# gate rewrites on every run. If the checkout applies an end-of-line
# conversion the generator does not, the regenerated file never matches the
# checked-out one and the working tree is reported dirty after every gate
# run — on some platforms only, so CI stays green while contributors see a
# file they did not change.
#
# Declaring LF in the working tree removes the conversion, so generated
# bytes and committed bytes are the same bytes everywhere.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
